,{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle","type":"reference"},{"text":" of itself, so you can pass one anywhere a bundle is expected,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","type":"reference"},{"text":" that matches the entities holding it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Requiring Other Components","anchor":"Requiring-Other-Components","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A component can require others. Spawning an entity with the component, or inserting the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component into an entity, also inserts each required component the entity doesn’t hold, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whatever those components require in turn. List the required components in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component\/required-u15k"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct Player: Component {","    static var required: some Bundle {","        Position(x: 0, y: 0)","        Health(current: 100)","    }","}","","var world = World()","let player = world.spawn(Player(), Health(current: 50))","","print(world[Position.self, of: player])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 0.0, y: 0.0)\"","print(world[Health.self, of: player].current)","\/\/ Prints \"50\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A component given explicitly, like the health in the example above, is kept: required"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components fill in only the types the entity doesn’t already hold."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"Component","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"